arden and seasonal access information before arrival.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"scioto-audubon-climbing-wall","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Scioto Audubon Climbing Wall","title":"Climb the outdoor wall","subtitle":"Scioto Audubon Metro Park, 400 W. Whittier St.","notes":"Bring the required personal gear, review wall rules, and use the auto-belays only when they are installed for the season.","short_summary":"A free outdoor climbing facility in a Columbus Metro Park.","evidence_claim":"Columbus and Franklin County Metro Parks describes the Scioto Audubon climbing wall as a free outdoor climbing wall.","source_url":"https://www.metroparks.net/programs-and-activities/park-activities/","source_title":"Park Activities | Metro Parks","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The wall is free; climbers must bring a harness, and seasonal hours and auto-belay availability apply.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"scioto-audubon-obstacle-course","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Scioto Audubon Obstacle Course","title":"Try the outdoor obstacle course","subtitle":"Scioto Audubon Metro Park, 400 W. Whittier St.","notes":"Wear closed-toe shoes, warm up first, and choose obstacles that match your group’s comfort level before repeating a circuit.","short_summary":"A free outdoor fitness course surrounded by a running track.","evidence_claim":"Columbus and Franklin County Metro Parks identifies Scioto Audubon’s obstacle course as free.","source_url":"https://www.metroparks.net/programs-and-activities/park-activities/","source_title":"Park Activities | Metro Parks","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The obstacle course is free to use; follow posted park rules and use it during park open hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"columbus-losinski-gallery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Losinski Gallery at Main Library","title":"See rotating Ohio art","subtitle":"Main Library, 96 S. Grant Ave.","notes":"Take the second floor at Main Library for a quiet art stop, then use the library’s public seating for a low-key conversation.","short_summary":"A free library gallery featuring established and emerging Ohio artists.","evidence_claim":"Columbus Metropolitan Library states that exhibits at the Losinski Gallery are free to attend.","source_url":"https://www.columbuslibrary.org/friends/patrick-losinski-gallery/","source_title":"Losinski Gallery at Main Library | Columbus Metropolitan Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Gallery exhibits are free to attend; check Main Library hours before traveling downtown.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ohio-statehouse-public-tour","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Ohio Statehouse Public Tour","title":"Join a Statehouse tour","subtitle":"Map Room, 1 Capitol Square","notes":"Arrive a few minutes before the hour at the Map Room for a walk-in tour, or take the self-guided route when it suits your group.","short_summary":"A free daily guided or self-guided look inside Ohio’s Statehouse.","evidence_claim":"The Ohio Statehouse offers free guided tours daily except on state holidays and permits self-guided tours.","source_url":"https://www.ohiostatehouse.org/visit/public-tours","source_title":"Public Tours | Ohio Statehouse","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free guided walk-in tours run daily except state holidays; groups of 10 or more should arrange ahead.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":